WEBVTT

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.920
Can I ask you for a favour?

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.520
Could you please help my Chiho?

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.590
Let me tell you this, though... That Ashikabi's illness cannot be treated by modern medical practices.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.550
However, if there were someone to surpass modern medicine...

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.970
The M.B.I...

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.890
And I'd love to help you.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.810
R-Really?

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:27.980
That is...!

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:34.740
Only if you can make it to the top floor of the Capital Tower by tomorrow, using your own strength!

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:39.610
All those who successfully manage to prevent him from doing so,

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:47.390
will be exempted from the termination of function, and an amazing prize will await them!

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:51.170
Even already victorious individuals are encouraged to participate.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.180
W-We're locked in...

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.410
atarashii yakusoku ga kokoro wo tsuyoku tsunagu

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.410
Our new promise binds our hearts together strongly

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:19.500
kawaru sekai ni kane ga hibiku yukou

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:19.500
The bell rings in the changing world, let's go

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:26.340
owari naki tatakai ga subete wo hiki saitemo

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:26.340
Even if the endless fight shreds everything apart,

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:32.520
kimi no hohoemi tada shinjite

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:32.520
I will believe in your smile

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.730
kimi no yume mamoreru nara

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.730
If I can protect your dream,

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.320
itami sae dakishimeyou

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.320
I will even embrace pain

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:49.620
kasane au kono omoi mune no chikai yuzurenai

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:49.620
I can't let go of these piling feelings, this oath in my heart

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:56.370
aa, sora no haruka hate made

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:56.370
Ah, all the way to the end of the sky,

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:04.590
sou, kakete yuku you na kasoku shiteku jounetsu

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:01.170
yes, my passion accelerates

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:04.590
as if it were rushing through my body

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:10.760
aa, donna unmei datte

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:10.760
Ah, no matter what kind of fate awaits me,

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:21.900
sou, takaku koeteku makenai yuuki kureta kara

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:15.060
yes, I can fly high over it

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:21.900
because you gave me this undefeatable courage

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:32.520
Twelfth Wing:

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:32.520
The Tower of Chaotic Play

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:38.110
It looks like a well-built shutter.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.390
Did he think we would try to get away?

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.110
That aside...

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:45.970
It's too quiet, isn't it?

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:49.280
Maybe they have a day off today?

00:02:55.620 --> 00:03:02.230
This is a special mechanical shield; no sensors will be able to detect us within 2 meter radius.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.300
Hello, ladies and gentlemen!

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:09.850
Minaka?!

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:14.310
Very well, let us begin the game...

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:19.850
In fact, I'm pretty busy, so I won't be able to play with you for too long.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:24.200
I've decided to play for only an hour a day.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:31.870
If you successfully manage to reach the top floor within 60 minutes, I shall grant what you wished for.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.870
Within 60 minutes?!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.810
Nevertheless, I pray for your success!

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:41.160
The elevator doesn't work. No surprise there.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.460
Which means we don't have any other choice but to climb the stairs...

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.390
Well, that wasn't entertaining at all.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.170
Don't tell me...!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:07.110
That used to happen quite often when my powers were still unstable...

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.870
However, I'm in full control now.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.370
Because he saved me, that is.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.350
This is bad!

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.170
We'll be roasted at this rate!

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.300
Let's retreat for the moment.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.410
I've got to hurry and find Matsu...

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.350
Takami-san?

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.690
Finally got through...

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.110
Are you still outside?

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:47.730
What do you mean?

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:51.990
It's useless. There's no signal in here.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.890
Are Onii-chan and the rest going to be all right?

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:59.160
We just have to have faith in Mina-tan, and find the server room as fast as possible.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:02.720
Maa-chan, someone's coming.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.490
That's weird...

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.730
I thought we would find them instantly.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:17.600
What's wrong?

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.860
So Matsu is heading for the Tower's main server...

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.250
This is bad.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.230
Why?

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:27.940
That place is dangerous.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:33.240
I'll try to stop that moron Minaka somehow.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:35.290
You go after Matsu and Kusano right now.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.750
Please, make it in time...

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:46.770
I'll do this in one shot... until the 120th floor...

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.700
Huh? Where are the stairs?

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.680
They're on the other side, Minato-san.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.130
This is taking much longer than I thought it would.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.030
Oh, watch out!

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:15.410
What the-

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:22.580
Kazehana-san!

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.970
I see. So this is your "game"...

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.300
Kazehana-san, are you all right?

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:33.320
I'm fine over here! Can you guys go on ahead without me?

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:38.760
It seems like... someone wants to play with me.

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:53.530
The miniboss has appeared.

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:59.490
Oh, young ones! Overcome all the trials, and make your way to me.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:05.120
Kazehana-san, is someone else over there?!

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:05.870
Why you...!

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.610
I already told you I'm fine. Go on now!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.090
B-But...!

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.590
You made a promise, didn't you?

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.970
Please. Promise me.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:21.640
You have a more important thing to do, right?

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.600
Water Celebration!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:25.850
It's useless.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.660
Not working at all...

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.440
Let's keep going.

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:33.360
What?

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.190
But, Kazehana-san is

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.620
I...

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.190
I believe in... Kazehana-san...

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:43.080
I believe in... all of my Sekirei.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.320
I understand.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:51.270
If that's how you feel, then I have no objections.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.550
I also believe in Kazehana-san.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:56.970
Kazehana-san! Make sure you catch up to us later!

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.570
'Kay!

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:04.600
Goodness... he really became a fine man.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:08.940
This is no time to look the other way!

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:15.690
Oh, come on. Don't ruin the mood now.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:19.110
Let's see how long you'll be able to keep up that attitude.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.610
The air is constricted in a sealed place such as this.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.420
None of your wind skills will work here.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.100
Wow.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.090
You sure thought this through.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.010
Water Arrow!

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:45.540
Are you okay, Minato-san?

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.960
Y-Yeah.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.100
Honestly, you just can't let your guard down here.

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:50.940
Tsukiumi, behind you!

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:55.490
I won't let you get any further.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:09:00.050
And the second miniboss appears right here.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.340
What is it?

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.010
I sense something bad coming.

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.270
It's Homura-tan...

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:16.800
Wow. What a coincidence, Mutsu.

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:19.220
This voice... Is it...?!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:20.690
Who is she?

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.680
So it <i>is you after all.</i>

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:26.310
Hey, what's wrong, Maa-cha-

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:28.960
No. 04

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.380
Wait, 04...?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.710
The one from the Disciplinary Squad? What is she doing here?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.980
Stand back, Mikogami.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:40.140
It's been a while since we've fought.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.490
It's too dangerous down there.

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:49.270
Let's stay on the air ducts.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:54.490
I don't like the atmosphere in this tower right now.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:10:00.610
Everyone from the Disciplinary Squad is here, except for No. 01.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:17.360
I'll hold her off here!

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.730
I will fight as well!

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:19.440
No, you won't!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.860
You can only get a minute in this situation.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:24.660
You should head for the top as fast as you can while protecting Minato!

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:25.910
Tsukiumi-san!

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:27.870
Water Celebration!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.500
Go, Minato!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.270
Tsukiumi...

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:39.420
All right. I'll leave this to you.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:43.210
Musubi, keep him safe until you reach the top floor.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.190
I'm counting on you.

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:45.680
I understand.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.470
You take care as well, Tsukiumi-san.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:51.220
Also, you two don't get too comfortable when you're alone!

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:52.030
Okay!

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:54.690
What are you two talking about at a time like this...

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.470
Let's go, Minato-san.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.320
Y-Yeah.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.480
And now I have nothing to worry about...

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:07.070
No. 06 Tsukiumi, incoming!

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.030
Here-we-go!

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:10.830
Here-we-go!

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.540
Here-we-go!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.550
All right! Who's next?!

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:20.890
That hurts... you asshole...!

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.170
Hey, Master...

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.170
It's burning...

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:28.110
That's because my spirit is always hot and blazing!

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.030
I wasn't talking about you, that place is...

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.680
Oh? A fire?!

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:33.690
Hey! It's coming from the garden, isn't it?

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:34.940
Did they do that?

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.650
I see now. They're over there.

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:38.150
Let's go!

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:39.110
Okay!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:52.630
I'll get even more famous if I defeat a member of the Disciplinary Squad!

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:53.410
Go get her!

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.870
Easier said than done.

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:03.300
Oh, come on! What are you doing?!

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:06.180
Looks like your skills are sharp as ever.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:10.010
Having an Ashikabi order you around must be a lot of fun, huh?

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.640
It's better than doing a dog's work.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:19.040
Why is it always this complicated?

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:27.160
That bastard Minaka... Setting up a ridiculous trap like this...

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:32.790
I have to catch up to them before they reach the server...

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:35.620
The trap that's awaiting them there is...

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:40.880
Kusano-tan, you okay?

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.460
I'm fine.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:46.520
It's just a little further. Let's keep going!

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.090
Let's do this, Maa-chan!

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.020
Yes!

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.490
Damn you!

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:14.920
Where did you go?

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:35.300
She fell into the trap, huh?

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:37.840
Open up, Minaka!

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.870
You stop this foolish game right

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.980
Forgive me, Takami-kun.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:45.460
I don't want anyone to disturb me during the game.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.320
It looks like we won't be able to get in there.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.270
The Tower's closed down, too.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.860
Dammit, at this rate...

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:00.290
Hold on a sec.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.600
That's right...

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.640
We don't really have to stop the North...

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:07.040
If we just defeat any Sekirei right here...

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:11.420
The number of competitors will drop... Right?

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.430
Are they fighting each other?

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:23.940
Just a little more!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:31.280
Are you all right, Minato-san?

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:33.560
Yeah... I-I'm fine...

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.950
M-Musubi-chan, above you!

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.590
Watch out!

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:39.700
I got this!

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.460
A-Amazing...

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:51.170
And that's how you do it.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:54.430
Otherwise, the other things will have gone to waste.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:59.720
We will keep growing stronger with your great willpower.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.400
Mine...?

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:05.950
Yes! Ashikabi and Sekirei are connected.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:07.640
And so are we...

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:12.230
That is why... we won't lose!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.650
Well, this is kind of tough...

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:20.080
I actually wanted to fight No. 88, though.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:23.260
Oh? Am I number two then?

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:27.000
We just had a score to settle, that's all. Dammit.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:29.670
A score to settle with Musubi-chan...?

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.440
An opponent Mutsu cannot defeat...

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.510
What kind of a monster is she?

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.700
It just never ends...!

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.120
It stopped...?

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:54.360
This is the end! See ya!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.320
Wh-Why?

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:00.650
Oh?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:06.210
I-It stopped?

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:09.040
Huh? My controller...

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:15.420
It's sunny outside today! Mina-tan, can you hear me?

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.880
Matsu-san!

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.420
I've taken over the Capital Tower.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.100
Onii-chan!

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:22.720
Kuu-chan!

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:26.640
I've disabled all the traps.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.720
It's time for some payback, Miss Flat-Chest.

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:52.580
Let's hurry, Musubi-chan! Climbing up is all that's left!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.210
Okay!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.860
Now you can move at ease!

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.540
I'll have to take my leave now.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.880
It was fun fighting you, Mutsu. I'll see you later.

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:07.240
Like I'd want to.

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:09.490
Why aren't you chasing her?

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:12.990
There's no point in fighting someone like her.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.850
We're leaving, Mikogami.

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:16.900
Huh? What about the treasure?

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.110
Damn, I didn't make it in time!

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:24.420
Inside that server room, there's a system that will eliminate any intruder without question.

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:26.520
If Minaka activates it...!

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:30.490
There are no more obstructions in the way.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:33.040
I don't think Matsu can override it.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:40.880
Oh, dear! There will be consequences if you cheat in this game, you know...

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:48.850
M-Maa-chan!

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:50.270
What's wron-

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:01.320
Water Celebration!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.470
Running away now?!

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:12.830
Haihane?

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.590
Stop!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.660
Kazehana!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:18.070
Oh, so you were fine.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.000
Of course I am.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.280
Why are you running away?

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:24.570
Orders. "Once the traps are disabled..."

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:26.660
Oh, right...

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.860
I wanted to finish her off before that happened.

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:30.390
What are you talking about?!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:34.930
It's the end... for everyone...

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:35.430
What?

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:37.400
You'll regret it once this is over.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.820
Extreme Earthquake!

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:46.670
Did they get away?

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:48.090
Looks like it.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.620
But, what were they talking about?

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:54.080
So the guard system is separated from the main one...

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:58.500
But don't think you'll be able to take us down with this!

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:01.290
Kusano-tan, show them!

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.970
I'll try to stop them!

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.810
Hang in there, Kusano-tan!

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:13.730
I know! Kuu is doing her best!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.870
I'd expect nothing less from my Sekirei!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:19.020
However,

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:21.980
how about... this?

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.020
Maa-chan!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.830
Just a bit more...! I'll stop them right now!

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:39.970
The entire system's locked down.

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:45.210
This is getting boring.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:48.080
And I'm hungry, too... Let's go home.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.270
Idiot, that switch is...!

00:19:55.270 --> 00:20:02.500
The self-destruct mechanism I made. I'm just speeding up the schedule. Don't you worry, Takami-kun!

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:06.560
What have you done...

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:09.100
What's the matter?

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.840
Please, retreat to a safe location.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.530
I don't care about that!

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:14.560
It's the president's order.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:18.620
It appears it's getting quite dangerous in here, after all.

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.680
Takami-kun, go on, run away.

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.540
Minaka, you asshole!

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.760
A-An explosion?

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:26.130
It's coming from below.

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.340
What's going on?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:30.890
Everyone, calm down and listen to me.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:34.950
It seems that the building's self-destruct mechanism has been activated.

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:36.860
Self-destruct mechanism?!

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.660
Can you all hear me?!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:40.650
President?!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:47.740
As a token of my appreciation for your splendid performance, I shall now reward you with the final special event!

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:51.690
I'll call it "The Great Escape From an Exploding Building!"

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:56.750
Now, if you don't hurry up... you might just end up losing your life!

00:20:57.220 --> 00:21:00.170
Minaka... You bastard, just how far are you willing to go...!

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:03.160
I could release the lock if I had the password...

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:07.110
But there's no time left!

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:16.090
O-Onii-chan!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.070
Minato!

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:28.910
This is... kind of bad, isn't it?

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:53.200
unmei nante ne zenbu de kimi shidai

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:53.200
All kinds of fate depend on you

00:21:54.430 --> 00:22:02.000
tsuiteku doko made mo onaji kimochi wo kakaete

00:21:54.430 --> 00:22:02.000
I'll follow you anywhere carrying the same feelings

00:22:12.960 --> 00:22:18.980
mada dare ni mo hakken sarete inai michi mo tairiku ni sou

00:22:12.960 --> 00:22:18.980
Even roads that haven't been found by anyone follow the mainland

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:24.720
ichiban saki ni fumidasu you na bouken nano kono koi wa kitto

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:24.720
This love is probably like an adventure we're stepping into before anyone else

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:29.910
shinjitsu da yo kanjiteru koto subete

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:29.910
Everything that you feel is the truth

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:35.550
sono koe ga ima yondeiru kara

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:35.550
Since that voice is calling me now

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:37.330
itsudemo

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:37.330
Whenever it may be

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:43.290
mukou da to wakatte temo issho ni tameshitai no

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:43.290
Even if I know it's useless I want to try it out together

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:50.260
nanni mo iranai ne kimi ga warau tabi

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:50.260
I don't need anything, hey whenever you laugh

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:56.180
ikiteru sono imi wa toki akasarete

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:56.180
the meaning of my life becomes obvious to me

00:22:56.180 --> 00:23:02.480
unmei nante ne zenbu de kimi shidai

00:22:56.180 --> 00:23:02.480
All kinds of fate depend on you

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:08.840
tsuiteku doko made mo onaji kimochi wo

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:08.840
I'll follow you carrying the same

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:14.270
tsuyoi kimochi wo kakaete

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:14.270
strong feelings

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:21.840
The Sekirei Project has finally entered its second phase!

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:24.560
Is a good or a bad end awaiting us?

00:23:24.560 --> 00:23:29.420
Whatever the end might be, we're heading towards it!

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:34.220
The Last Wing, The Bond of Truth.

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:36.510
Wherever it is, forever and ever.
